g"><path d="M8 4a.5.5 0 0 1 .5.5v3h3a.5.5 0 0 1 0 1h-3v3a.5.5 0 0 1-1 0v-3h-3a.5.5 0 0 1 0-1h3v-3A.5.5 0 0 1 8 4"></path></svg></div></div><div hidden="" id="replo-:Rpr2:"><div data-rid="b56a5746-ba1d-494f-87cf-f5c1367d8936" class="r-1qj54z3"><div data-rid="925bd3c1-082c-4450-a1f8-566c4a304bbd" class="r-16b3w0r alchemy-rte"><span style="width:100%"><p>Your trial starts the day your items are marked delivered by the shipping courier. The trial period is 7 days.</p><br><p>Initiate your return before your trial ends by emailing us at <a href="mailto:support@patrickadairdesigns.com">support@patrickadairdesigns.com</a> with your order # and the items you wish to return.</p><br><p>Once a return is initiated, you then have 5 days to return the products. You are responsible for return shipping costs on any products being returned.</p></span></div></div></div></div><div data-rid="bb4bc3a0-82d4-4338-b624-112adddcd981" class="r-m1zxhf" data-replo-collapsible="true" data-state="closed" data-orientation="vertical"><div data-rid="95a8243c-80f8-4b21-8430-695997af5831" aria-expanded="false" aria-controls="replo-:R19r2:" tabindex="0" role="button" class="r-j0tbca"><div data-rid="b535951c-28e3-4f18-a2a4-6478d2a4eedb" class="r-dvrar8 alchemy-rte"><span style="width:100%"><p>Why is there an authorization on my card?</p></span></div><div data-rid="d101e659-ed28-4071-9c59-e5106571529a" class="r-1c6bp4y" aria-hidden="true"><svg stroke="currentColor" fill="currentColor" stroke-width="0" viewBox="0 0 16 16" role="img" aria-label="Collapse/Expand" style="width:var(--rsw, 100%);height:100%" class="r-4x5rm2" height="1em" width="1em" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg"><path d="M8 4a.5.5 0 0 1 .5.5v3h3a.5.5 0 0 1 0 1h-3v3a.5.5 0 0 1-1 0v-3h-3a.5.5 0 0 1 0-1h3v-3A.5.5 0 0 1 8 4"></path></svg></div></div><div hidden="" id="replo-:R19r2:"><div data-rid="4a456d34-d88b-45f3-9673-42c1c9715dbf" class="r-17mg3yo"><div data-rid="0b69f737-2543-428f-8b58-58847d7f7b4a" class="r-sx588q alchemy-rte"><span sty